     "titulo": "Travelling",
     "texto": [
      "**Otel** = hotel; **oda** = room; **rezervasyon** = reservation. **Bir oda istiyorum** = I want a room.",
      "**Tek kişilik oda** = single room; **iki kişilik oda** = double room. **Kahvaltı dahil mi?** = is breakfast included?",
      "**Giriş** is entrance or check-in, and **çıkış** is exit or check-out."
     ],
